 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "NC State・品種: 晩冬〜早春に刈る以外ほとんど手入れ不要。RHS・MBG・Walters も早春の刈り取りのみ。おぎはらの「姿が乱れたら切る」は決まった文なので C にしない。機械の B を A に変更",
  "management_type_quote": "'Northwind' requires very little maintenance except to cut back the foliage in late winter or early spring.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "B 花後刈込型",
  "heat_west_only": null,
  "muggy_west_only": "中",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/品種] Some susceptibility to rust, particularly in hot and humid summer climates.\n[NC State/品種] In hot and humid climates, this grass can be susceptible to rust.\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: South-facing or West-facing or East-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 2／NC State・品種] It spreads by creeping rhizomes.（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・品種] Plants may self-seed in optimum growing conditions（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／MBG・品種] Plants may self-seed in optimum growing conditions but cultivars may not come true from seed.\n[地下茎 2／NC State・品種] It spreads by creeping rhizomes.\n[地下茎の食い違い] MBG は 1 相当\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち）",
